# Inkflame · Lantern loading animation

A hand-painted line lantern assembled by a moving flame. Tapered amber brushwork,
forged gothic scrolls, and three interleaved flame silhouettes on near-black.
All artwork is authored vector geometry. There are no generated image plates,
film-grain overlays, noise textures, fonts, logo, percentage, or progress bar.

